x-w-7xl overflow-hidden px-5 py-24 md:px-8 md:py-32\"><p class=\"mb-3 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.4em] text-grey\">Flight log — missions that landed</p><h2 class=\"font-display text-4xl font-bold uppercase leading-tight md:text-6xl\">Proof, not<br/><span class=\"text-outline\">promises.</span></h2><div class=\"mt-20 flex flex-col gap-28\"><div class=\"vx-case relative\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"vx-case-num pointer-events-none absolute -top-14 right-0 select-none font-display text-[9rem] font-bold leading-none text-ivory/[0.05] md:text-[15rem]\">01</span><div class=\"vx-case-body relative\"><p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-grey\">IPG Estates · Real Estate</p><h3 class=\"font-display mt-3 max-w-3xl text-3xl font-bold uppercase leading-[1.05] text-ivory md:text-5xl\">We sell the dream before the cement dries.</h3><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-grey md:text-base\">Raw construction sites turned into cinematic CGI walk-throughs that pull qualified buyers. One interior reel alone crossed 94.7K organic views.</p><div class=\"mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-x-12 gap-y-5\"><div><div class=\"font-display text-3xl font-bold text-ivory md:text-4xl\">94.7K</div><div class=\"mt-1 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-grey\">interior reel views</div></div><div><div class=\"font-display text-3xl font-bold text-ivory md:text-4xl\">83</div><div class=\"mt-1 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-grey\">posts shipped</div></div><div><div class=\"font-display text-3xl font-bold text-ivory md:text-4xl\">CGI 3D</div><div class=\"mt-1 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-grey\">walk-throughs &amp; films</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"vx-case relative\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"vx-case-num pointer-events-none absolute -top-14 right-0 select-none font-display text-[9rem] font-bold leading-none text-ivory/[0.05] md:text-[15rem]\">02</span><div class=\"vx-case-body relative\"><p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-grey\">Short-form Campaign · Media</p><h3 class=\"font-display mt-3 max-w-3xl text-3xl font-bold uppercase leading-[1.05] text-ivory md:text-5xl\">6M views. 3,075 followers. Do the math.</h3><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-grey md:text-base\">A standing-start short-form machine built on scripting, design and cadence — not ad spend or bought followers. The algorithm didn&#x27;t make this happen. Our content did.</p><div class=\"mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-x-12 gap-y-5\"><div><div class=\"font-display text-3xl font-bold text-ivory md:text-4xl\">6M+</div><div class=\"mt-1 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-grey\">views in 60 days</div></div><div><div class=\"font-display text-3xl font-bold text-ivory md:text-4xl\">280K</div><div class=\"mt-1 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-grey\">single reel views</div></div><div><div class=\"font-display text-3xl font-bold text-ivory md:text-4xl\">0</div><div class=\"mt-1 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-grey\">rupees of ad spend</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"vx-case relative\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"vx-case-num pointer-events-none absolute -top-14 right-0 select-none font-display text-[9rem] font-bold leading-none text-ivory/[0.05] md:text-[15rem]\">03</span><div class=\"vx-case-body relative\"><p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-grey\">Manufacturing · Recruitment</p><h3 class=\"font-display mt-3 max-w-3xl text-3xl font-bold uppercase leading-[1.05] text-ivory md:text-5xl\">We don&#x27;t just fill feeds. We filled a factory.</h3><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-grey md:text-base\">An entire workforce hired before the factory opened — GM to weavers to cooks — through short-form video and hyper-targeted ads. No agencies, no headhunter fees.</p><div class=\"mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-x-12 gap-y-5\"><div><div class=\"font-display text-3xl font-bold text-ivory md:text-4xl\">30+</div><div class=\"mt-1 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-grey\">roles filled</div></div><div><div class=\"font-display text-3xl font-bold text-ivory md:text-4xl\">0</div><div class=\"mt-1 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-grey\">recruiters used</div></div><div><div class=\"font-display text-3xl font-bold text-ivory md:text-4xl\">170K+</div><div class=\"mt-1 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-grey\">campaign views</div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"process\" class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 py-24 md:px-8 md:py-32\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-14 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1.4fr]\"><div class=\"lg:sticky lg:top-28 lg:h-fit\"><p class=\"mb-3 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.4em] text-grey\">Mission control — the operating system</p><h2 class=\"font-display text-4xl font-bold uppercase leading-[1.05] md:text-6xl\">Same rig.<br/>Every brand.<br/><span class=\"text-outline\">Zero luck.</span></h2><p class=\"mt-5 max-w-sm text-sm leading-relaxed text-grey md:text-base\">Growth here is repeatable, not lucky. Six steps, run in order, every single time. We planet. You profit.</p></div><div class=\"vx-process-steps relative pl-10 md:pl-14\"><div class=\"absolute left-2.5 top-0 h-full w-px bg-ivory/10 md:left-4\"></div><div class=\"vx-process-line absolute left-2.5 top-0 h-full w-px bg-ivory md:left-4\"></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-14\"><div class=\"vx-step relative\"><span class=\"absolute -left-10 top-1.5 h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full border border-ivory bg-carbon md:-left-[46px]\"></span><div class=\"flex items-baseline gap-4\"><span class=\"font-display text-sm font-bold text-grey\">01</span><h3 class=\"font-display text-2xl font-bold uppercase text-ivory md:text-3xl\">Discover</h3></div><p class=\"mt-2 max-w-md text-sm leading-relaxed text-grey md:text-base\">Pressure-test the goal, market and maths before making a thing.</p></div><div class=\"vx-step relative\"><span class=\"